    {
      "text": "Fieldworks",
      "start": 0.0,
      "duration": 1.65
    },
    {
      "text": "Generative artworks and interactive environments by Brad Necyk.",
      "start": 1.83,
      "duration": 5.15
    },
    {
      "text": "A surface that answers. A fold in seeing. An unfinished sky. Impossible matter. A river remembering a drawing. A small vocabulary, an expanding field. A field of competing futures. Seven encounters with the living physics of Cyberdelic OS.",
      "start": 7.16,
      "duration": 18.4
    },
    {
      "text": "These are living, revisable artworks. They are not Bitcoin inscriptions.",
      "start": 25.74,
      "duration": 5.2
    }
